#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:5
#: 5400b11b2885419f97beb0b944bd707c
msgid "Autotest Framework"
msgstr "自动化测试框架"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:9
#: aa448053c8324784935bfe5ef640be8f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's AutoTest suite allows for the creation of repeatable tests which"
" help prevent regressions in ArduPilot's behavior.  It is based on "
"ArduPilot's :ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` architecture - "
"i.e. a fully-software-based solution."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的自动化测试套件（AutoTest）允许创建可重复的测试，有助于防止 ArduPilot 行为出现回归。它基于 ArduPilot "
"的 :ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` 架构，即完全基于软件的解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:14
#: 5b88ff31a1fe42c2a5f495e6dc85a34d
msgid "Using ArduPilot's AutoTest can:"
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 自动化测试可以："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:16
#: bb9953e35f1c49efbbb28436da6f4d77
msgid ""
"make your development process more efficient by reducing time spent "
"repeatedly running the same scenario in ``sim_vehicle.py``"
msgstr "减少在 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 中反复运行相同场景的时间，从而提高开发效率"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:17
#: e34e2e3ca9ea42159b6e870b56fb4769
msgid ""
"allow you to repeatedly replicate bad behavior in ArduPilot, and possibly "
"ship that test to a developer capable of fixing the issue (\"test-driven-"
"development\")"
msgstr "允许您反复复现 ArduPilot 中的不良行为，并可能将该测试提交给有能力修复该问题的开发者（「测试驱动开发」）"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:18
#: e385501690884dcdab1a6cbb92d12d91
msgid ""
"reduce the chances of a regression in ArduPilot's behavior by locking in "
"tests for that behavior"
msgstr "通过锁定针对特定行为的测试，降低 ArduPilot 出现行为回归的风险"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:21
#: 22928fdb10574605ab2a1657d956ac7a
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:23
#: 35abc621ee6147d6a8dcdc5a7cc7552e
msgid ""
"The AutoTest suite is run on ArduPilot's autotest server on most commits to "
"the master branch but can be run locally to vet software changes.  Adding "
"tests is straightforward and encouraged to show how patches improve flight "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"自动化测试套件在大多数提交到 master 分支时会在 ArduPilot "
"自动化测试服务器上运行，也可在本地运行以验证软件变更。添加测试非常简单，鼓励通过测试展示补丁如何改善飞行行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:30
#: a9e365bdf8bb4959aadb921de9087df2
msgid "Running AutoTest"
msgstr "运行 AutoTest"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:34
#: ad4da1c8bbeb47e68a427b133c9468ef
msgid ""
"Don't run autotest.py with no parameters - unless you know what you are "
"doing or like cleaning up large messes."
msgstr "除非您清楚自己在做什么或乐于收拾大乱摊子，否则请不要在无参数的情况下运行 autotest.py。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:36
#: 032cbcede26b43699b9687fbdf16fec5
msgid ""
"AutoTest requires a valid SITL environment to run.  Use the SITL "
"instructions (:ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`) to obtain a "
"valid environment.  It is suggested the ArduPilot Vagrant virtual machine "
"configuration files be used to obtain a working environment."
msgstr ""
"AutoTest 需要有效的 SITL 环境才能运行。请使用 SITL 说明（:ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>`）获取有效环境。建议使用 ArduPilot Vagrant 虚拟机配置文件获取可用环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:39
#: beb7a5cc9d29499787593648b0fc6029
msgid "Invocation"
msgstr "调用方式"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:43
#: bb41e3f231994c1b897a20b63927de6a
msgid ""
"running autotest with high-levels of ``--speedup`` can result in enough "
"network traffic that MAVProxy can't keep up.  An error such as \"Set RC "
"override timeout\" or the vehicle entering GCS failsafe are typical of these"
" failures.  Re-running will often allow the tests to pass.  Reducing the "
"``--speedup`` factor is typically sufficient to avoid this problem."
msgstr ""
"以高 ``--speedup`` 参数运行自动化测试可能产生大量网络流量，导致 MAVProxy 无法跟上。「Set RC override "
"timeout」或飞行器进入 GCS 失效保护等错误是此类失败的典型表现。重新运行通常可以让测试通过。降低 ``--speedup`` "
"参数通常足以避免此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:46
#: ad65a9bbf3054f4b8069d410a0af22d3
msgid "Help is available:"
msgstr "可获取帮助："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:80
#: 75095706305e454ead021f5a2d31c8ba
msgid ""
"``autotest.py`` is invoked with a sequence of \"steps\" which will be "
"executed in order:"
msgstr "``autotest.py`` 通过一系列按顺序执行的「步骤」来调用："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:86
#: 828eb5e6dc174c15a71ca784b683aafd
msgid ""
"This command is valid in the root directory of an ArduPilot checkout.  It "
"instructs AutoTest to build the ArduCopter SITL binary, start that binary, "
"test it and then kill it.  The output (:ref:`sample <autotest-verbose>`) is "
"extremely verbose, but a summary is given once all steps have been run."
msgstr ""
"此命令在 ArduPilot checkout 的根目录中有效。它指示 AutoTest 构建 ArduCopter SITL "
"二进制文件、启动该二进制文件、进行测试，然后终止。输出（:ref:`示例 <autotest-verbose>`）极为详细，但所有步骤完成后会给出摘要。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:94
#: fea04f80218b49769758a74ac6584ec8
msgid "Older versions of ``autotest.py`` used these steps:"
msgstr "旧版本的 ``autotest.py`` 使用以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:101
#: 524f4650b09b4565bde35ebc87d4d1f8
msgid "``--list`` : list available steps (build, test, defaults, examples)"
msgstr "``--list``：列出可用步骤（构建、测试、默认值、示例）"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:105
#: 3388bd8bc3b946308d3fdbc40df4dac4
msgid ""
"The ``--no-clean`` option can greatly reduce your development-cycle-time"
msgstr "``--no-clean`` 选项可大幅缩短开发周期时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:109
#: 83333a7a51b7477fb92412bfc81a506a
msgid ""
"When developing tests, consider omitting the \"build\" step - unless you are"
" changing ArduPilot code."
msgstr "开发测试时，如果您没有修改 ArduPilot 代码，可考虑省略「build」步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:112
#: 20e2043c5bf3445d8c12820a941afca8
msgid "Complex Invocation"
msgstr "复杂调用"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:118
#: bb60664e4ae7440fb3b10183b6324915
msgid ""
"At the time of writing, these invoke all the vehicle tests.  Expect these to"
" take about 40 minutes to run."
msgstr "在撰写本文时，这些命令会调用所有飞行器测试。预计运行约需 40 分钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:121
#: 118407d8eff944e088dfe094ba6ca0bd
msgid "Running a specific sub-test"
msgstr "运行特定子测试"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:123
#: f5471b92c73a4bda9ffc5ee6dc77ae35
msgid ""
"To run a specific sub-test just add the test name with a '.' between the "
"test and sub-test names."
msgstr "要运行特定子测试，只需在测试名称和子测试名称之间用「.」连接并添加即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:131
#: 6e7f06a9bd034cc89be8f06f9c9dce9e
msgid "Using with GDB"
msgstr "结合 GDB 使用"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:133
#: fde67615483a4b95a4b1a6c9430ca71b
msgid "AutoTest can run the ArduPilot binary under gdb:"
msgstr "AutoTest 可以在 GDB 下运行 ArduPilot 二进制文件："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:139
#: 0c9ea0db6fdf4ca2840cb7bbecbaf72c
msgid ""
"In an X Windowing System environment, an xterm window will contain the GDB "
"terminal; stderr from the ArduPilot binary will also appear in this window."
"  Where X is not available but `GNU screen "
"<https://www.gnu.org/software/screen/>`__ is, a detached screen will be "
"created with the same content."
msgstr ""
"在 X 窗口系统环境中，一个 xterm 窗口将包含 GDB 终端；ArduPilot 二进制文件的 stderr 也将显示在该窗口中。当 X 不可用但"
" `GNU screen <https://www.gnu.org/software/screen/>`__ 可用时，将创建一个包含相同内容的后台 "
"screen 会话。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:141
#: 287771ec3c294d84b3c687db45d9975a
msgid ""
"You can insert breakpoints on the command-line (use multiple times to insert"
" multiple breakpoints):"
msgstr "您可以在命令行插入断点（多次使用可插入多个断点）："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:147
#: b1c0f8b9df0c4c78983a3fabbb09d7c6
msgid ""
"You can insert a Python method call into your test to cause the autopilot to"
" enter the attached debugger:"
msgstr "您可以在测试中插入 Python 方法调用，使自动驾驶仪进入已附加的调试器："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:153
#: d47dcd42f49249cb9451250ac6103ecf
msgid ""
"This feature works well when combined with the ``--disable-breakpoints`` "
"command-line option as you can enable the breakpoints when the debug trap is"
" sent."
msgstr "此功能与 ``--disable-breakpoints`` 命令行选项结合使用效果很好，因为可以在发送调试陷阱时启用断点。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:156
#: 2bbe6c137b85495db7fd4b3ae3778424
msgid "Using with Valgrind"
msgstr "结合 Valgrind 使用"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:158
#: 5291c363079c40dc8e03da2abb2d2fdc
msgid ""
"AutoTest can run the ArduPilot binary under the Valgrind memcheck tool.  "
"This is useful for finding the reading of uninitialised memory and the like."
msgstr "AutoTest 可以在 Valgrind 内存检测工具下运行 ArduPilot 二进制文件，这对于查找读取未初始化内存等问题非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:162
#: 6de99b8da6144bf6986c0a9629e4e397
msgid ""
"ArduPilot initializes most of its dynamically-allocated memory to zero by "
"overriding the ``new`` function.  Some versions of Valgrind do not "
"understand this.  The supplied xenial32 Vagrant virtual machine contains a "
"version of Valgrind which does not suffer from this issue."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过重写 ``new`` 函数将其大部分动态分配的内存初始化为零。某些版本的 Valgrind 无法识别此行为。提供的 "
"xenial32 Vagrant 虚拟机中包含一个不受此问题影响的 Valgrind 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:168
#: 2017e28838ec4d058a4e18be5866ab4d
msgid ""
"Special log files (e.g. ``arducopter-+-valgrind.log``) are created by "
"autotest when run with this tool.  They should always be empty at the end of"
" an autotest run."
msgstr ""
"使用此工具运行 autotest 时，会创建特殊日志文件（如 "
"``arducopter-+-valgrind.log``）。自动化测试运行结束后这些文件应始终为空。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:172
#: 5f4a9293d3c9438290ec9ed6414d03cb
msgid "Extracting Results"
msgstr "提取结果"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:174
#: 56c15a06320547aa83c8579d387d13c9
msgid "After AutoTest has run, several log files are available."
msgstr "AutoTest 运行后，将有多个日志文件可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:176
#: 3f644a2cb62b408cb226d4becada271d
msgid "The log on ``autotest.py``'s stdout is obvious!"
msgstr "``autotest.py`` 的标准输出日志显而易见！"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:178
#: a7df19cdb52d4bf3801b589c9adc4e54
msgid "DataFlash files are available in the \"logs\" directory:"
msgstr "DataFlash 文件位于「logs」目录："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:190
#: f6a0a37f560d472b9861bf668bf38863
msgid ""
"The MAVLink telemetry logs are present in the \"buildlogs\" directory.  This"
" directory is typically created one-level-higher than the ArduPilot root "
"directory."
msgstr "MAVLink 遥测日志位于「buildlogs」目录，该目录通常在 ArduPilot 根目录上一级创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:200
#: 02a35e180f91404587f7a0cb626f959d
msgid ""
"On the Vagrant virtual machine, the ArduPilot root directory is mounted on "
"/vagrant.  The \"vagrant\" user has no permission to create the "
"\"buildlogs\" directory in \"/\", so instead, the buildlogs directory "
"appears at /tmp/buildlogs"
msgstr ""
"在 Vagrant 虚拟机上，ArduPilot 根目录挂载在 "
"/vagrant。「vagrant」用户无权在「/」中创建「buildlogs」目录，因此 buildlogs 目录出现在 "
"/tmp/buildlogs。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:204
#: 75b9788d3008498891d291fd66482f35
msgid ""
"Not all MAVLink traffic involved in the testing is present in the buildlogs "
"tlog file.  Only traffic to/from MAVProxy itself (as opposed to additional "
"MAVProxy --outputs) is present.  See AutoTest Structure for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"并非所有测试相关的 MAVLink 流量都存在于 buildlogs tlog 文件中。只有 MAVProxy 本身的流量（而非通过 MAVProxy "
"--outputs 输出的额外流量）才会被记录。更多信息请参阅「AutoTest 结构」。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:207
#: 902dfe762b9045fd99bb4674517bc79f
msgid "Correlation of Output Files with the autotest server"
msgstr "输出文件与自动化测试服务器的对应关系"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:209
#: 2ca925b6769e48c1a5f43b95c3e7dd33
msgid ""
"`ArduPilot's autotest server <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ displays "
"the results of the most recent AutoTest run.  If a test is failing on the "
"autotest server, it should be possible to replicate that failure locally "
"using ``autotest.py``"
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot 自动化测试服务器 <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ 显示最新 AutoTest "
"运行的结果。如果测试在自动化测试服务器上失败，应可以使用 ``autotest.py`` 在本地复现该失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:211
#: 5778da6949484ff686157121460f3083
msgid ""
"AutoTest's \"Test Results\" section reflects ``autotest.py``'s return value "
"for each of the steps."
msgstr "AutoTest 的「Test Results」部分反映了 ``autotest.py`` 每个步骤的返回值。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:213
#: ebd971cd38b147959ba66c743ec984d4
msgid ""
"AutoTest's \"Test Logs\" section reflects the contents of the buildlogs "
"directory."
msgstr "AutoTest 的「Test Logs」部分反映了 buildlogs 目录的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:215
#: 0c0d0313bf60472da60cf80ec2c9508f
msgid ""
"AutoTest's \"Flight Tracks\" section's images can be created using the "
"\"convertgpx\" step."
msgstr "AutoTest 的「Flight Tracks」部分的图像可通过「convertgpx」步骤创建。"

