#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:253
#: 6ea169e2f5174aa284c3c5ec9a419df0
msgid "self.mavproxy"
msgstr "self.mavproxy"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:253
#: 708531a88c224cacab6387d2d147d401
msgid ""
"An pexpect object used to interact with the MAVProxy process.  All MAVProxy "
"commands are valid when sent to this object - e.g. ``set shownoise 0``.  "
"This is not always available - self.start_mavproxy() and "
"self.stop_mavproxy() should be used by a test if it requires MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"一个用于与 MAVProxy 进程交互的 pexpect 对象。发送给该对象的所有 MAVProxy 命令均有效，例如 ``set shownoise "
"0``。该对象并非始终可用——若测试需要 MAVProxy，应使用 self.start_mavproxy() 和 "
"self.stop_mavproxy()。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:256
#: 979b2dcd7b064743ac7fcd3a216f7b49
msgid "self.mav"
msgstr "self.mav"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:256
#: 3b1d21fd17614349a7c5d39cfe3dbb5c
msgid ""
"A mavudp object connected to a the primary output port of the simulation "
"(usually TCP port 5760)."
msgstr "一个连接到仿真主输出端口（通常为 TCP 5760 端口）的 mavudp 对象。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:259
#: cef3d9b057bb4133b172fe0a0fd02359
msgid "self.mav.mav"
msgstr "self.mav.mav"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:259
#: 8dfb21f11aa14bd8a7850a01f8fa2a6d
msgid ""
"The mavudp's MAVLink object.  Can be used to send messages via MAVLink to "
"the SITL binary: ``self.mav.mav.system_time_send(time.time() * 1000000, 0)``"
msgstr ""
"mavudp 的 MAVLink 对象。可用于通过 MAVLink 向 SITL "
"二进制文件发送消息：``self.mav.mav.system_time_send(time.time() * 1000000, 0)``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:262
#: 836a37521a274fbea41ccf28ffa193de
msgid "RC Overrides"
msgstr "RC 覆盖"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:264
#: a024a21970174e9b8cdb23290042f54e
msgid ""
"A test's call to ``self.set_rc(ch, value)`` effectively sets the RC inputs "
"for the simulated vehicle.  It is important to note that these are not \"RC "
"overrides\" - it is \"real\" simulated RC input.  The SITL binary listens on"
" a network port for packets of 8-bit or 16-bit quantities representing the "
"RC input.  MAVProxy is invoked in such a way that data which it would "
"otherwise have sent as MAVLink RC override packets are delivered to that "
"network socket instead."
msgstr ""
"测试中调用 ``self.set_rc(ch, value)`` 实际上设置了仿真飞行器的 RC 输入。需要注意的是，这不是「RC "
"覆盖」，而是「真实的」仿真 RC 输入。SITL 二进制文件监听一个网络端口上表示 RC 输入的 8 位或 16 位数据包。MAVProxy "
"被配置为将其原本作为 MAVLink RC 覆盖包发送的数据改为发送到该网络套接字。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:273
#: 9f1726dd5b38423d82ee3eaa4b12b734
msgid "Adding a Test"
msgstr "添加测试"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:277
#: 0c72f5661bba48a28ec78de1e38aa3fe
msgid ""
"The autotest script is in flux.  This documentation may be out of date."
msgstr "自动化测试脚本仍在不断调整，本文档可能已过时。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:279
#: 7635d7b2885d4d40be5dd44b3d5f6d1c
msgid ""
"`This "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/commit/e045f61473afa800afc241819cf890591fbecd5a>`__"
" git commit is a reasonable example of adding an entirely new test to the "
"ArduPilot suite."
msgstr ""
"`此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/commit/e045f61473afa800afc241819cf890591fbecd5a>`__"
" git 提交是向 ArduPilot 套件添加全新测试的合理示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:283
#: 6336544152ec4b1a96593f1eed60a4a1
msgid "Conducting an automated git bisect with an autotest"
msgstr "使用自动化测试进行自动 git bisect"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:285
#: d5729df612b3477e9c40a0b4be628f02
msgid ""
"``Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py`` can be used as the script argument to "
"``git bisect run``.  It can run an autotest test - by name - and tell you "
"which commit broke that test."
msgstr ""
"``Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py`` 可作为 ``git bisect run`` "
"的脚本参数使用。它可按名称运行自动化测试，并告诉您哪次提交导致了该测试失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:287
#: bf2044ca957844248a326e2c12a4973d
msgid "To accomplish this:"
msgstr "具体步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:289
#: 6a269ee78bbc4a99afce737519e2f1ce
msgid "make sure you're not already running a bisect - ``git bisect reset``"
msgstr "确保您当前没有在进行 bisect——``git bisect reset``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:290
#: 43bc7e6b0acc4690907e587638908f61
msgid ""
"create a topic branch for your new test (based on master) which fails now "
"but you know would have passed at some stage in the past"
msgstr "基于 master 为新测试创建一个主题分支，该测试现在失败，但您知道在过去的某个时间点是可以通过的"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:291
#: 627c78e22dab4d6dbb7fc00aa6395823
msgid ""
"write your test - which should fail on your topic branch, and commit it"
msgstr "编写您的测试——该测试应在您的主题分支上失败，然后提交"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:292
#: 94fde1ec98f84009a064a56296998724
msgid ""
"you can test your branch by creating a branch at some stage in the past and "
"cherry-picking your test into that branch.  This may not be trivial "
"depending on what changes have been made in the autotest framework"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在过去的某个时间点创建一个分支，并将您的测试 cherry-pick 到该分支来测试您的分支。具体难易程度取决于自动化测试框架中发生的变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:293
#: 842052d7cafd45f285b615f899c8cb59
msgid ""
"``cp Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py /tmp``  # always use modern helper"
msgstr "``cp Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py /tmp``  # 始终使用最新的 helper"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:294
#: f3fda80f64544ed592492b1093bc8122
msgid "``git bisect reset``"
msgstr "``git bisect reset``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:295
#: abe889a62c354712bbf2d1feb722f7a3
msgid "``git bisect start``"
msgstr "``git bisect start``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:296
#: 145dde1b28544c749c21df30979404b1
msgid "``git bisect bad``  - we know the test fails where it was written"
msgstr "``git bisect bad``  ——我们知道测试在编写时所处的提交处失败"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:297
#: 1e14bcec724f4631b2843fe3e5077de4
msgid "``git bisect good HEAD~1024``  - this is where we know the test passes"
msgstr "``git bisect good HEAD~1024``  ——这是我们知道测试通过的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:298
#: 1434858fc1514278abaf6fa6d5475a8d
msgid ""
"``time git bisect run /tmp/bisect-helper.py --autotest --autotest-"
"vehicle=Plane --autotest-test=NeedEKFToArm --autotest-branch=wip/bisection-"
"using-named-test``"
msgstr ""
"``time git bisect run /tmp/bisect-helper.py --autotest --autotest-"
"vehicle=Plane --autotest-test=NeedEKFToArm --autotest-branch=wip/bisection-"
"using-named-test``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:300
#: f5c5c223ef1a49d181c78b25224bbf3c
msgid ""
"In the last command, you need to specify the vehicle, new test name, and the"
" name of the topic branch which contains your new test."
msgstr "在最后一条命令中，您需要指定飞行器类型、新测试名称，以及包含新测试的 topic 分支名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:302
#: d7421599013747ca9378fa57fcb148d8
msgid ""
"After this has run you should know which commit broke the functionality "
"being tested.  And you also have a new test for the regression suite which "
"you should PR!"
msgstr "运行完成后，您应该能够确定是哪个 commit 破坏了被测功能。同时，您也得到了一个新的回归测试，请提交 PR！"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:306
#: 40feb00aaed5480781d0364aca959507
msgid "Using with callgrind / kcachegrind"
msgstr "与 callgrind / kcachegrind 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:308
#: ab0eb7ec402a434198b7fc7f6123a871
msgid ""
"Valgrind is actually a collection of tools - mostly it is used with the "
"\"memcheck\" tool to find memory read/write problems."
msgstr "Valgrind 实际上是一套工具集——通常使用其 「memcheck」 工具来检测内存读写问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:310
#: d93232d83c064acda927868c7874958d
msgid ""
"Valgrind's callgrind tool allows for performance analysis.  autotest.py has "
"built-in support for running ArduPilot under callgrind."
msgstr ""
"Valgrind 的 callgrind 工具可用于性能分析。autotest.py 内置了在 callgrind 下运行 ArduPilot 的支持。"
